                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 5,
                            "last_played": 1750823655
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I really don't enjoy giving a game a negative review, but the experience I had while playing Ramify was truly frustrating. I bought this game because it looked like it could be a lot of fun, and I was eager to unlock some of the points shop items. I thought, why not give it a try? \n\nTo obtain the point shop items, you need to accumulate at least two hours of playtime. When I first started playing, I was pleasantly surprised. I quickly reached level three and was genuinely enjoying the game. But then, out of nowhere, I experienced a game crash. I thought it might just be a one-time glitch since it was my first time playing. \n\nUnfortunately, when I launched the game again, the same issue occurred, this time not even a minute into gameplay! This continues to happen no matter how many times I boot the game. I did some research but couldn't find much information on this issue online, apart from a single review on the store page, which was quite surprising. At this rate, it seems unlikely that I will ever receive my points shop items or achievements. \n\nI'm thoroughly disappointed with the overall experience. Fortunately, I only spent £2.49 on this game, so I’m not too devastated. I’ve decided not to request a refund because I hold out hope that the developers will address this issue in the future.",
